    Reproduce: a nudge moved into quiet hours by spring-forward is not silent
    
    The test fails on the current code: the nudge is delivered at 03:00 EDT,
    inside quiet hours that start at 03:00, but silent is False. Quiet hours
    are judged at the nominal 02:00, which doesn't exist that night.
    
    Refs: S-114 AC3

diff --git a/tests/test_nudge.py b/tests/test_nudge.py
